WEBVTT

00:15.932 --> 00:17.934
[opening theme music playing]

00:40.248 --> 00:44.961
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:45.045 --> 00:47.422
[indistinct chatter]

00:57.974 --> 00:58.808
She's not here.

01:00.977 --> 01:03.188
- Only Bu-yeon's boat disappeared?
- Yes.

01:04.773 --> 01:08.151
Does it mean that…
that the bride was kidnapped?

01:11.279 --> 01:12.572
Who would do this?

01:15.950 --> 01:16.785
Come on.

01:18.286 --> 01:19.120
All right.

01:19.913 --> 01:21.539
[soft music playing]

01:38.348 --> 01:40.141
I'm very happy that you came.

01:47.524 --> 01:48.399
What are you doing right now?

01:48.483 --> 01:49.984
Are you not going to carry me like this?

01:51.444 --> 01:53.488
- Can you walk?
- Of course, I can.

01:53.571 --> 01:55.240
But people will come look for me soon,

01:55.323 --> 01:57.867
so it will be faster if
you just carry me with your spell.

01:58.618 --> 02:00.453
Oh, if you're worried about that…

02:02.956 --> 02:03.915
then just walk.

02:10.964 --> 02:12.715
[Bu-yeon] I thought you were
the strongest man in Daeho.

02:12.799 --> 02:15.009
Carrying me should be
easy for you, should it not?

02:16.928 --> 02:20.723
I don't want to waste my energy
and nor do you look all that light so…

02:21.724 --> 02:25.270
That's because I'm wearing so many layers.
It's even hard to walk.

02:28.523 --> 02:29.524
[Jang Uk] Then…

02:30.984 --> 02:32.735
- take them off.
- Right here?

02:32.819 --> 02:34.028
Yeah, take them off.

02:36.406 --> 02:37.407
But…

02:37.490 --> 02:40.910
I mean, this does seem
like a pretty deserted place and…

02:42.745 --> 02:45.790
I know you're a little impatient,
but doing it here is a bit…

02:47.000 --> 02:48.293
You know what I mean?

02:50.461 --> 02:53.214
After all, this is
our first night together.

02:55.049 --> 02:56.342
Unbelievable. Listen.

02:56.926 --> 02:58.595
I was telling you
to take off that cumbersome robe.

02:58.678 --> 03:00.013
Did you really think I would actually…

03:01.431 --> 03:04.809
- You think I was asking that?
- No, of course not. Sorry!

03:04.893 --> 03:08.104
I'm just in a hurry.
I got a little carried away.

03:09.564 --> 03:10.690
Hey, wait.

03:10.773 --> 03:13.401
Do not worry.
I'm taking off the robe, just the robe.

03:16.112 --> 03:19.616
But are you sure you were not locked up
because you're ill up here or something?

03:20.283 --> 03:21.367
It is true that I was ill.

03:22.410 --> 03:24.370
So ill that I was on the verge of death,

03:25.288 --> 03:27.081
but my mother found me and treated me.

03:27.832 --> 03:29.000
What made you ill if I may ask?

03:29.083 --> 03:32.420
Well, to be honest,
I don't really know either.

03:33.087 --> 03:34.631
By the time I regained consciousness,

03:35.506 --> 03:37.175
I was already a lot better.

03:39.218 --> 03:40.637
I mean how could you not know?

03:40.720 --> 03:43.431
You may not remember anything
from when you were unconscious,

03:43.514 --> 03:45.099
but what about anything before that?

03:45.808 --> 03:47.977
You didn't even know if you were sick
due to an injury or an illness?

03:49.520 --> 03:50.355
I…

03:51.648 --> 03:53.483
have no memories at all before Jinyowon.

03:54.108 --> 03:55.860
I forgot everything after while I was ill.

03:58.238 --> 04:00.073
And it's because of that reason

04:00.907 --> 04:02.617
why my mother kept me a secret,

04:04.786 --> 04:05.745
and hid me away.

04:08.915 --> 04:09.999
[sighs]

04:18.549 --> 04:19.384
[Cho-yeon sighs]

04:20.176 --> 04:21.844
Bu-yeon's existence was unknown to all.

04:21.928 --> 04:23.680
So who could have gone and just taken her?

04:25.098 --> 04:26.432
Songrim's Park Dang-gu

04:27.308 --> 04:29.102
knew that Jinyowon was having a wedding.

04:29.811 --> 04:31.771
Maybe he thought it was my wedding

04:31.854 --> 04:34.899
and stole the boat carrying Bu-yeon,
hoping to ruin it all.

04:42.573 --> 04:44.909
You're saying the person
from Jinyowon getting married

04:44.993 --> 04:47.203
is not Jin Cho-yeon but Jin Bu-yeon?

04:48.079 --> 04:51.457
Yes. She and my Uncle Yun-o,
who came here with me,

04:51.958 --> 04:53.668
are having
a small wedding ceremony in secret.

04:54.669 --> 04:55.545
[exclaims]

04:56.587 --> 04:59.090
Dang-gu, I'm only telling you
so you'll stop all the crying, okay?

04:59.173 --> 05:00.258
[Dang-gu sobbing]

05:03.386 --> 05:04.220
[Seo Yul] Here.

05:05.346 --> 05:06.180
Thank you.

05:09.350 --> 05:10.268
[Seo Yul sighs]

05:12.395 --> 05:13.938
That's not Jin Cho-yeon then.

05:15.231 --> 05:16.065
But wait a minute.

05:17.483 --> 05:19.402
Jin Bu-yeon was actually alive though?

05:20.528 --> 05:22.113
Have you seen her, Yul?

05:22.196 --> 05:24.240
- What's Bu-yeon like?
- I haven't met her.

05:25.074 --> 05:26.868
Uncle Yun-o told me earlier that

05:26.951 --> 05:28.703
he'd introduce me
to her after the wedding.

05:29.912 --> 05:31.247
I suppose I'm gonna find out then.

05:36.836 --> 05:40.298
[Jang Uk] I was told you were blind,
but you can see. That is also strange.

05:41.132 --> 05:42.800
[Bu-yeon] Apparently,
I was blind when I was little,

05:42.884 --> 05:44.761
but my sight came back after I recovered.

05:45.636 --> 05:46.929
Not that I remember any of that.

05:57.565 --> 05:59.567
[suspenseful music playing]

06:07.325 --> 06:08.951
- What?
- You don't have it.

06:11.329 --> 06:12.663
What are you talking about?

06:13.331 --> 06:14.624
The blue mark of a soul shifter.

06:15.374 --> 06:16.459
Sometimes the energy enters

06:16.542 --> 06:18.419
through the eyes
and enables a blind person to see.

06:19.420 --> 06:20.713
That is not what happened to you.

06:21.589 --> 06:23.216
I thought the mark is supposed to be here.

06:24.050 --> 06:25.176
Can it also be in their eyes?

06:25.760 --> 06:26.594
Yes.

06:27.595 --> 06:29.013
I have never heard of such a thing though.

06:29.972 --> 06:31.390
Because only I have seen it.

06:32.725 --> 06:35.728
Then again, you are a mage
who hunts down soul shifters.

06:35.812 --> 06:37.855
Then you found
and killed that soul shifter, right?

06:44.654 --> 06:46.614
What? Didn't you catch them?

06:49.033 --> 06:50.618
- She died.
- "She died"?

06:52.328 --> 06:53.704
So you didn't kill her.

06:57.834 --> 06:59.335
I see, someone else killed her.

07:00.128 --> 07:02.046
Was it someone you knew?
Were you close to her?

07:02.130 --> 07:03.589
You ask a lot of unnecessary questions.

07:05.091 --> 07:07.760
I told you my story, so I just wanted
to know more about you. That's all.

07:07.844 --> 07:09.804
I know I picked you
as my husband on a whim,

07:10.471 --> 07:12.056
but I still want to know
what kind of person you are.

07:12.140 --> 07:14.767
You wouldn't stop telling me
how great I was when you picked me,

07:14.851 --> 07:16.936
but now that you have me,
you are gonna start to get picky?

07:17.019 --> 07:19.480
I want to know you more, can I not?

07:19.564 --> 07:22.942
You're in no position to leave me,
you may not even like me.

07:23.943 --> 07:25.236
I thought you wanted someone

07:25.319 --> 07:27.613
who could defy your mother
and help you be thrown out.

07:28.781 --> 07:30.825
If it is a loving husband
you are looking for

07:30.908 --> 07:33.578
and not the rope you hung to escape,
then let go of me right now.

07:34.537 --> 07:36.706
I will turn that boat around
and send you back to where you were.

07:42.044 --> 07:43.129
I won't let go.

07:43.212 --> 07:45.423
As long as you free me
from that awful room,

07:47.008 --> 07:48.718
even if you are a terrible husband,

07:49.760 --> 07:51.179
I will always stay with you.

07:53.431 --> 07:55.016
Well, I will not be that terrible.

07:55.516 --> 07:56.976
I'll at least be tolerable,
so don't worry.

07:57.518 --> 07:58.352
But…

07:59.562 --> 08:00.730
why did you come help me then?

08:01.230 --> 08:03.149
It's not like
you were captivated by my beauty

08:03.232 --> 08:05.026
or you pitied my situation.

08:07.528 --> 08:10.448
So what is it then that you want from me?

08:16.829 --> 08:17.663
You…

08:18.372 --> 08:19.999
you told me you can see energy inside me.

08:21.375 --> 08:24.045
This is… the ice stone.

08:26.964 --> 08:28.549
The ice stone?

08:29.133 --> 08:31.052
It is said that Jin Bu-yeon

08:31.135 --> 08:33.763
found the ice stone in the lake
and took it out long ago.

08:35.389 --> 08:37.058
- I did?
- You don't need to remember.

08:37.141 --> 08:39.060
As long as you still have your powers,

08:39.894 --> 08:40.937
that is what I need from you.

08:49.403 --> 08:50.780
So he wants my powers.

08:54.075 --> 08:54.992
[sighs]

08:56.244 --> 08:58.287
[eerie music playing]

09:17.890 --> 09:19.141
[grotesque] It's the ice stone.

09:19.725 --> 09:21.894
He possesses the ice stone.

09:47.628 --> 09:48.546
[grunts]

09:55.177 --> 09:57.179
[eerie music continues playing]

10:21.829 --> 10:22.747
[screams]

10:44.977 --> 10:49.440
[Go Won] They say wraiths and grotesques
always flock to Jang Uk's side.

10:49.523 --> 10:52.818
Perhaps that's why I get an eerie feeling
every time after meeting with him.

10:53.402 --> 10:56.739
Then stop listening to Master Lee
and stop visiting him altogether.

10:57.990 --> 10:59.825
But he still bothers me somehow.

10:59.909 --> 11:02.078
And I do get curious about how he's doing.

11:02.787 --> 11:05.748
Jang Uk cannot use that power
whenever he wants to.

11:06.582 --> 11:07.667
If he ever does,

11:08.167 --> 11:09.919
Park Jin will have to give up his life.

11:10.002 --> 11:12.421
Because that is what he originally
promised to everyone

11:12.505 --> 11:14.590
when he decided
to step down as the leader.

11:16.384 --> 11:19.303
And obviously, I have you to thank,
Jin Mu, for helping me keep Jang Uk…

11:20.805 --> 11:22.223
in the palm of my hand like this.

11:23.724 --> 11:25.726
I'm grateful for your acknowledgment.

11:27.436 --> 11:29.814
Jang Uk is to be used just as a tool,

11:29.897 --> 11:32.358
merely think of him as a way
to use the energy of the sky.

11:42.660 --> 11:43.994
[Jang Uk] Did Jin Mu say

11:44.078 --> 11:46.247
you should just dismiss me
so that you feel better?

11:54.672 --> 11:55.506
Uncle Yun-o.

11:56.257 --> 11:58.467
Didn't you say that
you were going to get married tonight?

11:59.969 --> 12:02.304
I couldn't. Someone stole my bride.

12:03.431 --> 12:06.434
[sighs]
The new leader of Songrim, Park Dang-gu

12:06.517 --> 12:10.104
most likely thought I was marrying
Jin Cho-yeon and kidnapped the bride.

12:13.732 --> 12:14.567
I…

12:16.026 --> 12:16.944
did what now?

12:17.736 --> 12:19.738
[tense music playing]

12:22.700 --> 12:25.870
I'm here to retrieve
what Park Dang-gu has stolen.

12:25.953 --> 12:28.372
Find and bring the thief here
to me right now this instant.

12:28.456 --> 12:32.585
And what exactly did our leader steal from
Jinyowon that has you acting this way?

12:33.461 --> 12:36.255
Look, you cannot come here
in the middle of the night

12:36.338 --> 12:38.132
and demand we turn our leader over.

12:38.215 --> 12:39.800
Have you no sense of decency?

12:39.884 --> 12:42.428
If you try to hide him,
I will find him myself.

12:44.138 --> 12:46.307
Search this place thoroughly
for Park Dang-gu at once.

12:46.390 --> 12:47.391
[Jin] You will not.

12:53.230 --> 12:54.273
Lord Dang-gu has arrived.

13:01.155 --> 13:03.782
Lady Jin Ho-gyeong, please
do not be mistaken. It was really not me!

13:04.617 --> 13:06.869
I was not the one who kidnapped
the bride before the wedding.

13:07.453 --> 13:08.287
"Wedding"?

13:09.622 --> 13:10.498
"The bride"?

13:10.581 --> 13:12.500
Jinyowon was holding a wedding,
you knew this.

13:12.583 --> 13:14.335
[Ho-gyeong] You went around
asking about it, did you not?

13:16.545 --> 13:18.631
Well, I-- Yes, I did.

13:21.008 --> 13:22.843
But I thought that it was
Young Lady Cho-yeon's wedding.

13:23.427 --> 13:25.513
And I did want to run right over
and ruin the ceremony,

13:25.596 --> 13:26.972
but I didn't do that.

13:29.225 --> 13:30.976
Dang-gu and I
were together for the entire night.

13:31.602 --> 13:32.811
He's not the one who took…

13:35.523 --> 13:36.815
Young Lady Jin Bu-yeon.

13:41.779 --> 13:45.199
So the thing you claimed
was stolen and came here to find

13:45.282 --> 13:48.619
was really Jin Bu-yeon,
your eldest daughter?

13:50.746 --> 13:53.457
My goodness, I'm too old for this.

13:53.541 --> 13:55.751
What is all this nonsense
about Jin Bu-yeon?

13:55.834 --> 13:57.127
Isn't she dead, huh?

13:57.211 --> 13:59.338
Jin Cho-yeon, tell me, what is going on?

14:00.589 --> 14:02.591
[Cho-yeon] Um, well…

14:04.343 --> 14:05.219
[sighs]

14:06.011 --> 14:07.429
My sister is here.

14:08.347 --> 14:11.141
She's been with us
for the last three years.

14:11.225 --> 14:12.643
What? She's alive?

14:12.726 --> 14:15.771
Yes, that's right.
I came here looking for my Bu-yeon.

14:16.605 --> 14:18.857
And today, she disappeared
during her wedding.

14:19.817 --> 14:22.987
I was too flustered
about having lost my precious daughter.

14:23.696 --> 14:27.783
I was disrespectful. I apologize.
We will take our leave now.

14:46.594 --> 14:47.428
Jin Bu-yeon.

14:49.597 --> 14:50.681
So you are still alive.

14:53.851 --> 14:54.768
[Dang-gu sighs]

14:55.519 --> 14:57.771
[Dang-gu]
Why was Young Lady Cho-yeon so angry?

14:57.855 --> 14:59.857
She came here certain that it was you,

15:00.357 --> 15:02.359
so she was probably embarrassed
and upset about it.

15:03.777 --> 15:05.237
It's understandable that she's mad

15:05.779 --> 15:08.407
since you did nothing even though
you thought she was marrying another man.

15:10.993 --> 15:12.536
I am the leader of Songrim now.

15:12.620 --> 15:14.747
I only held back
because I cannot do what I want.

15:15.539 --> 15:16.707
Would you have been able to do it?

15:20.377 --> 15:21.295
Being who I am now…

15:24.548 --> 15:25.466
I'm sure I would do it.

15:29.845 --> 15:32.139
Because I know
that I would regret every single day…

15:34.558 --> 15:36.226
the moment I chose to do nothing.

15:37.144 --> 15:38.562
When I realized it was her,

15:39.438 --> 15:41.607
I should have stepped forward
and held onto her

15:43.108 --> 15:44.443
instead of just backing away.

15:47.363 --> 15:48.280
Hey, Dang-gu.

15:50.616 --> 15:52.409
The most tragic thing in life is

15:53.327 --> 15:55.955
to reach the end and regret
all the things that you should have done.

15:58.165 --> 15:59.416
Please don't let that happen.

16:16.308 --> 16:18.936
- Young Master, you're back.
- [Jang Uk] Yes.

16:21.814 --> 16:22.898
Go on.

16:32.324 --> 16:35.327
What a lovely home!
It looks larger than Jinyowon.

16:38.706 --> 16:39.540
Now what?

16:40.124 --> 16:42.042
Are you calculating
how wealthy your husband is?

16:42.543 --> 16:44.253
Jinyowon is very wealthy too.

16:45.504 --> 16:48.882
Marrying a girl from a rich family like me
will help boost your wealth even more.

16:48.966 --> 16:52.261
I don't care. All I need is
that great divine power of yours.

16:53.637 --> 16:55.389
But wouldn't it be better

16:55.472 --> 16:58.392
if I had something more
to offer than my divine powers?

16:59.143 --> 16:59.977
No.

17:00.728 --> 17:02.855
Listen, I just need your power.

17:07.776 --> 17:09.862
But that is the one thing I don't possess.

17:11.905 --> 17:14.199
[sighs] I shouldn't have said
that they were great.

17:17.578 --> 17:18.412
[door closes]

17:21.040 --> 17:23.751
Young Master,
where on earth have you been?

17:23.834 --> 17:24.835
[Jang Uk] Oh…

17:27.379 --> 17:29.048
And who might you be?

17:29.757 --> 17:31.216
- I am--
- She's the girl I'm marrying.

17:32.134 --> 17:33.969
Yeah? Marrying?

17:34.928 --> 17:35.888
I mean so soon!

17:35.971 --> 17:37.765
Maidservant Kim, I'll explain later.

17:38.348 --> 17:40.976
For tonight, let's prepare
a room for her to rest in.

17:41.060 --> 17:42.603
She must be extremely exhausted.

17:44.396 --> 17:46.148
Please, Maidservant Kim.

17:47.691 --> 17:48.525
Yes, Young Master.

17:48.609 --> 17:50.903
I will ready a room
for her to rest in right away.

17:57.451 --> 18:00.704
Maidservant Kim has been
looking after me since the day I was born.

18:01.497 --> 18:04.583
She's a very dear person to me,
so please treat her with respect.

18:05.375 --> 18:08.212
She's kind at heart,
so she'll take good care of you.

18:08.295 --> 18:10.089
You asked a person that dear to you

18:11.256 --> 18:12.382
to look after me here?

18:13.675 --> 18:14.927
- Yeah?
- It's just that…

18:15.010 --> 18:16.929
I nearly forced you to take me with you,

18:17.471 --> 18:19.139
so I expected you to give me a hard time.

18:19.223 --> 18:21.433
I didn't expect to be treated so nicely.

18:22.684 --> 18:24.103
Who says I was forced to do so?

18:26.063 --> 18:28.023
Well, I can't say
I was the most welcoming,

18:29.108 --> 18:30.859
but I chose to help you
because I actually need you.

18:31.944 --> 18:35.114
Since we are marrying,
it's natural you be treated well.

18:35.906 --> 18:39.743
But still, everyone will question
why you suddenly decided to bring me here.

18:40.369 --> 18:41.578
Should I not be more careful?

18:41.662 --> 18:42.496
Why?

18:43.205 --> 18:45.666
I thought you came with me because
you were tired of being controlled,

18:46.959 --> 18:48.293
so why should you be more careful?

18:48.877 --> 18:50.087
Just do whatever you want.

18:50.796 --> 18:51.630
There's no one here

18:52.506 --> 18:54.383
who can do anything to you
no matter what you do.

18:56.802 --> 19:00.139
Since you put it that way,
I will do my best to feel at home here.

19:02.307 --> 19:03.142
[sniffles]

19:03.225 --> 19:06.353
I will accept your warm hospitality.

19:09.022 --> 19:11.817
[Maid Kim] You will find this room
to be the most comfortable.

19:11.900 --> 19:13.902
I will bring you some food immediately.

19:14.653 --> 19:16.780
[soft music playing]

19:25.455 --> 19:26.790
I hope it is to your liking.

19:27.291 --> 19:29.459
Tell me if you need
anything else from me, Young Lady.

19:30.127 --> 19:30.961
Thanks.

19:33.881 --> 19:35.299
[water running]

19:39.428 --> 19:42.097
When you are done bathing,
I will have clean clothes ready, okay?

19:45.100 --> 19:47.060
I didn't have time
to get you anything new,

19:47.728 --> 19:50.272
so I brought you clothes
that used to belong to Madam Do-hwa.

19:50.355 --> 19:51.523
They fit well on you.

19:52.024 --> 19:54.067
It's not only pretty but light and comfy.

19:54.985 --> 19:58.113
Um, do you think
it's all right if I keep these?

19:59.198 --> 20:00.032
Mm…

20:00.908 --> 20:05.621
they are neither modern nor trendy,
but if you like them, go ahead then.

20:06.705 --> 20:07.998
- Thank you.
- Of course.

20:14.463 --> 20:15.297
Uh…

20:18.258 --> 20:22.429
I know a lot of people, so, uh,

20:22.512 --> 20:26.433
I know almost
every noble young lady that is around.

20:26.516 --> 20:28.310
But I've never seen you before.

20:28.393 --> 20:31.813
I've never ventured outside of my house.
That's why you've never seen me.

20:31.897 --> 20:32.940
Ah…

20:33.649 --> 20:36.068
I guess your parents must be
very strict then.

20:42.741 --> 20:45.369
By the way,
where are the parents of this household?

20:45.452 --> 20:46.662
Are they not living here?

20:47.913 --> 20:49.414
Both of them passed away.

20:50.499 --> 20:51.333
Didn't you know that?

20:53.168 --> 20:56.129
Well… it hasn't been
too long since we met, so…

20:56.838 --> 20:58.090
Oh, could it be that…

20:58.840 --> 21:03.095
you don't know what happened
to our Young Master Jang three years ago?

21:06.265 --> 21:08.100
Well, you don't even know him,

21:08.642 --> 21:11.436
yet you followed him here
just because he asked you to do so?

21:11.937 --> 21:13.397
I was the one who suggested it.

21:14.356 --> 21:15.190
To marry me.

21:16.566 --> 21:17.734
It was me who asked him.

21:17.818 --> 21:19.653
And he just said yes to you,
just like that?

21:21.071 --> 21:21.905
Yes.

21:22.823 --> 21:23.824
[Maid Kim sighs]

21:23.907 --> 21:24.992
How strange!

21:26.034 --> 21:26.868
I thought that

21:27.577 --> 21:30.038
he would never think of
getting married ever again.

21:31.748 --> 21:32.958
[Maid Kim] This is so hard to believe.

21:34.835 --> 21:36.378
I wonder what he is thinking.

21:48.765 --> 21:50.475
[Jin] They say
Jin Bu-yeon had divine powers

21:50.559 --> 21:52.102
that were as powerful as Jin Seol-ran's.

21:52.728 --> 21:54.771
Do you wish to
take out the ice stone inside you?

21:55.897 --> 21:57.441
If you do that, you will die.

22:08.827 --> 22:09.911
Hey, you're all right?

22:10.746 --> 22:12.873
What happened? Why are you soaking wet?

22:13.874 --> 22:15.876
[eerie music playing]

22:16.543 --> 22:18.712
- [gasps]
- [growls]

22:18.795 --> 22:20.672
[watchman 1 screams]

22:24.718 --> 22:26.219
Look! Look, look!

22:30.098 --> 22:31.808
Hey, wake up, wake up!

22:32.642 --> 22:34.686
- Are you all right?
- [watchman 3] Is everything all right?

22:35.896 --> 22:36.938
[fisherman gasps]

22:37.689 --> 22:38.523
Where am I?

22:39.441 --> 22:40.734
How did I end up here?

22:45.489 --> 22:48.450
[watchman 1] I must find the ice stone.

22:54.664 --> 22:57.042
Weird… They said he'd be in his study.

23:07.177 --> 23:08.261
[exhales]

23:10.305 --> 23:11.139
Really?

23:12.599 --> 23:13.767
Are you stealing that from me?

23:15.060 --> 23:15.894
[clears throat]

23:17.020 --> 23:17.854
I'm very sorry.

23:18.438 --> 23:21.691
I'm just so used to having
to sneak around to steal drinks.

23:23.610 --> 23:24.653
Leave it.

23:41.628 --> 23:43.338
You said I could do as I wished here.

23:47.300 --> 23:49.177
I always stole alcohol and drank alone.

23:49.261 --> 23:52.013
Have a drink with me, Uk.
We should celebrate.

23:55.058 --> 23:57.018
[quirky music playing]

24:24.754 --> 24:25.589
If you drink that…

24:27.716 --> 24:29.342
that means
we're officially married, all right?

24:30.635 --> 24:32.596
Let us think of it as the wedding drink.

24:35.390 --> 24:37.267
Uk, drink up.

24:40.979 --> 24:41.980
A wedding drink?

24:48.153 --> 24:50.155
[quirky music continues playing]

24:57.913 --> 24:58.747
Go on. Drink!

25:03.919 --> 25:05.378
Why aren't you drinking it? Drink it!

25:05.462 --> 25:07.505
Because our wedding night feels
a bit rushed, that's why.

25:07.589 --> 25:08.924
No need to rush. The night's young.

25:09.007 --> 25:11.009
Summer nights are short!
The sun will rise any time now.

25:11.092 --> 25:13.595
What do night and day have to do
with becoming a married couple?

25:14.262 --> 25:16.473
I prefer the night.

25:18.767 --> 25:21.436
- I'm too shy during the day.
- [scoffs]

25:22.771 --> 25:24.731
You really have a way
of surprising me with your words.

25:27.234 --> 25:29.110
Do you know how bad it is
to drink during the day?

25:29.194 --> 25:31.780
Even when I stole liquor,
I only drank at night then too.

25:33.490 --> 25:34.324
So drink up.

25:37.786 --> 25:40.747
All right. I will drink
as soon as I check one thing first.

25:50.173 --> 25:51.341
This is our wedding night.

25:51.925 --> 25:53.009
You said you were shy.

26:03.853 --> 26:04.896
Here.

26:05.689 --> 26:07.482
You can go ahead
and turn off the last lantern.

26:07.565 --> 26:09.526
Oh, and for your information,

26:09.609 --> 26:12.654
I received this lantern as a gift
from Jinyowon quite a long time ago.

26:12.737 --> 26:16.157
They said it was a self-burning lantern
that can't be blown out.

26:17.242 --> 26:19.911
Anyway, you can't just simply blow it out.

26:20.495 --> 26:22.664
Since you're
a great priestess of Jinyowon,

26:23.331 --> 26:25.458
use your great divine power
to turn it off.

26:27.002 --> 26:28.003
I'm ready when you are.

26:29.629 --> 26:31.631
[suspenseful music playing]

27:00.452 --> 27:01.286
You can't do it.

27:03.872 --> 27:06.708
So you can't even do this?
You said you possess great powers.

27:07.334 --> 27:08.960
Apparently, I lost my powers…

27:10.587 --> 27:12.505
at the same time I lost my memory.

27:15.633 --> 27:17.552
Besides from seeing energy with my eyes…

27:22.265 --> 27:23.141
I can't do anything.

27:23.224 --> 27:25.226
Then you are absolutely
no use to me at all.

27:32.817 --> 27:34.152
Go back home once the sun rises.

27:34.235 --> 27:35.570
You said you've escaped before.

27:35.653 --> 27:37.030
Just tell them you got lost, okay?

27:39.366 --> 27:40.742
Do you know why I got caught

27:41.993 --> 27:43.370
every time I ran away?

27:54.714 --> 27:57.801
Because of this.
This is what they always use to find me.

28:03.807 --> 28:06.643
[female mage] The tracking thread found
the boat the bride was in.

28:17.028 --> 28:19.239
If we follow the energy
of the tracking thread,

28:20.073 --> 28:21.157
we will find the Young Lady.

28:23.910 --> 28:25.620
[Bu-yeon]
The thread is tightening around my wrist.

28:25.703 --> 28:27.705
That means they will be here shortly.

28:32.502 --> 28:34.045
So they put this on you.

28:35.422 --> 28:36.965
People from Jinyowon will come soon,

28:37.799 --> 28:39.926
and they will find out
it was you who took me.

28:40.510 --> 28:41.344
When they come…

28:43.388 --> 28:45.849
I will tell them we have become
a married couple already.

28:47.434 --> 28:48.435
This means that…

28:49.602 --> 28:51.229
I can't really send you back quietly.

28:51.312 --> 28:55.650
This thread comes from Jinyowon
and it cannot be cut by any kind of blade.

28:58.069 --> 28:58.903
Jang Uk.

29:00.655 --> 29:01.906
I do not wish to go back.

29:03.950 --> 29:04.993
I like it here.

29:09.289 --> 29:10.206
And I like you.

29:13.126 --> 29:15.628
[somber music playing]

29:51.831 --> 29:53.500
The energy of the thread is gone.

29:54.876 --> 29:56.336
[female mage] The thread has been cut.

30:01.674 --> 30:02.509
There.

30:03.468 --> 30:04.344
I cut it off.

30:05.470 --> 30:06.805
You can quietly return home.

30:12.477 --> 30:13.645
Leave once the sun rises.

30:20.527 --> 30:21.361
[sighs]

30:24.239 --> 30:25.240
I will leave here now.

30:25.323 --> 30:27.534
It will be more embarrassing
to be caught in broad daylight.

30:30.787 --> 30:32.121
I may have deceived you,

30:33.081 --> 30:34.415
but not all that was a lie.

30:35.375 --> 30:37.085
I actually do have powers.

30:37.710 --> 30:40.046
The person who treated me said
once my memory's back…

30:41.965 --> 30:43.883
my divine powers will return as well.

30:47.262 --> 30:48.471
I'm sorry I lied to you.

30:50.181 --> 30:51.599
Thank you for your hospitality.

30:52.600 --> 30:53.518
When I go back,

30:54.894 --> 30:56.729
I promise that
I will never mention your name.

30:58.565 --> 30:59.774
[Ho-gyeong] Bu-yeon has disappeared.

31:00.608 --> 31:04.821
Do you think her memory
and powers have fully returned?

31:06.531 --> 31:08.908
She could have possibly run away
if she has regained her memories.

31:09.993 --> 31:11.536
The soul inside that body…

31:12.996 --> 31:14.163
is Naksu after all.

31:14.247 --> 31:15.540
But it is Bu-yeon's body.

31:15.623 --> 31:18.251
Her blood is that of the eldest daughter
of the Jin family.

31:18.334 --> 31:21.087
Is that why you confined her

31:21.170 --> 31:23.089
and marry her off
to carry on the family line?

31:23.840 --> 31:26.551
Once she gave birth,
what were you going to do with the body

31:26.634 --> 31:29.178
that contained Naksu's soul?
You'd get rid of her again?

31:30.179 --> 31:32.265
Did you already forget
what you promised me

31:32.348 --> 31:34.893
three years ago
when you begged me to save her

31:35.602 --> 31:38.062
after you fished her body
out of Lake Gyeongcheondaeho?

31:46.529 --> 31:48.156
[Master Lee]
Her entire body has been petrified

31:48.239 --> 31:51.576
without a single ounce of water left,
yet somehow she's still alive.

31:51.659 --> 31:53.369
3 YEARS AGO

31:53.453 --> 31:57.624
Please save her!
She is my long-lost daughter, Master Lee.

31:57.707 --> 32:01.169
I found it strange that she never ran wild
even with Naksu's powerful energy.

32:01.252 --> 32:04.505
But it was because the body belonged
to a Jinyowon priestess.

32:06.257 --> 32:09.385
Naksu did not take over this body
using the alchemy of souls.

32:09.469 --> 32:12.639
The body trapped
Naksu's soul inside of it.

32:12.722 --> 32:15.683
She… I heard her call me "Mother".

32:15.767 --> 32:19.270
Bu-yeon's soul also still remains inside,

32:19.354 --> 32:20.688
inside this body here.

32:24.984 --> 32:25.985
The choice is all yours.

32:27.779 --> 32:29.197
The only way to keep this body alive

32:29.739 --> 32:32.784
is to use the energy of Naksu's
that still remains inside the body.

32:33.368 --> 32:35.870
Jin Bu-yeon's soul
is holding on to that energy.

32:36.579 --> 32:39.540
Naksu's energy can only be used
if we get rid of Bu-yeon's soul

32:39.624 --> 32:41.292
and leave Naksu's soul behind.

32:43.294 --> 32:44.337
Are you asking me

32:45.463 --> 32:49.092
to choose Naksu's soul
over my own dear daughter's soul?

32:51.010 --> 32:52.762
Or else, both of them will certainly die.

32:53.888 --> 32:54.722
What's your choice?

32:55.974 --> 32:58.601
Will you use Naksu's soul
to keep the body alive?

32:58.685 --> 33:01.312
Or will you keep your daughter's soul
and leave her to die?

33:03.815 --> 33:05.400
I will do as you decide, Ho-gyeong.

33:05.483 --> 33:06.609
[gasps]

33:06.693 --> 33:08.695
[tense music playing]

33:25.628 --> 33:27.839
[dramatic music playing]

34:04.542 --> 34:06.919
[Master Lee] Since she is recovering
using Naksu's energy,

34:07.003 --> 34:10.048
once water begins to flow
in her face and regains its form,

34:10.131 --> 34:11.966
her face is going to morph into Naksu's.

34:13.593 --> 34:16.012
As the body and soul need to be matched,
not to run wild.

34:16.888 --> 34:19.682
Are you saying that
I must think of that face as my daughter?

34:21.434 --> 34:25.104
This is the choice you've made.
You decided to use all of Naksu's energy

34:25.188 --> 34:27.356
in order to save
your daughter's body from petrifying.

34:29.859 --> 34:33.196
In exchange for gaining a new body,
she has lost all memories of her past.

34:33.780 --> 34:36.032
Naksu's soul remains, but she has now lost

34:36.699 --> 34:38.326
all of her energy and…

34:39.786 --> 34:40.912
her memories as well.

34:43.998 --> 34:46.000
[somber music playing]

35:04.435 --> 35:07.063
Because she has no memories,
she took you as her mother

35:07.146 --> 35:10.066
and did not at all struggle to
accept the fact that she is Jin Bu-yeon.

35:10.650 --> 35:13.069
She can open the doors to Jinyowon
and see energy

35:13.152 --> 35:14.862
because she has my daughter's blood.

35:14.946 --> 35:17.031
She doesn't have
the powers to do much else.

35:18.407 --> 35:21.577
My daughter played with
our Jinyowon's relics

35:21.661 --> 35:23.830
as if they were only just toys for her.

35:25.706 --> 35:27.458
Has she really lost her powers?

35:27.542 --> 35:31.546
Bu-yeon's body has lost its powers
and Naksu's soul has lost its memories.

35:31.629 --> 35:33.923
Body and soul have
become one without conflict.

35:34.757 --> 35:36.259
If she regains most of her powers,

35:36.843 --> 35:39.053
it is likely
her memories will return as well.

35:40.346 --> 35:41.180
Can you bear that?

35:43.015 --> 35:44.809
I'd rather have her stay this way

35:45.434 --> 35:47.854
than have Naksu's memories return.

35:47.937 --> 35:49.981
Then you're just going
to keep her confined?

35:51.983 --> 35:53.442
That is also my decision to make.

35:54.193 --> 35:57.155
And if I decide to kill her
because I cannot stand it anymore,

35:57.238 --> 35:58.364
that is also my choice.

35:59.448 --> 36:01.701
Did you not promise
to restrain your own judgment?

36:03.703 --> 36:05.621
Jang Uk loved Naksu with all his heart.

36:06.122 --> 36:09.167
If you tell him, I'm more than certain
that he'll help you protect her.

36:09.250 --> 36:12.461
No. Never!
The one he truly loved was Naksu.

36:15.590 --> 36:18.676
That girl will only be able
to live as my daughter.

36:20.178 --> 36:23.306
I will never let him find out about her.

36:25.183 --> 36:28.436
Besides,
Jang Uk doesn't know the real face

36:29.020 --> 36:30.646
of the woman he loved so much.

36:32.273 --> 36:35.401
[Ho-gyeong]
Even if the two ever meet face to face,

36:36.235 --> 36:40.198
they will never be able
to recognize each other.

36:45.286 --> 36:48.706
That is the price to be paid
for the pain I have to bear

36:49.207 --> 36:52.293
living my life
looking at that girl's face.

36:57.381 --> 36:59.091
[Master Lee]
I respected your decision as a mother

36:59.175 --> 37:02.011
and the fact that you told
no one of her existence.

37:02.595 --> 37:04.096
However, in the end, today…

37:05.890 --> 37:08.476
Bu-yeon's existence has finally
been revealed to the whole world.

37:10.269 --> 37:12.897
For now, I need to find her first.

37:13.481 --> 37:16.901
She's escaped a few times before,
and I always brought her back.

37:18.527 --> 37:19.403
We will find her…

37:21.781 --> 37:22.907
this time as well.

37:35.753 --> 37:36.963
Please take care, my lady.

37:47.014 --> 37:49.016
[ominous music playing]

37:59.193 --> 38:00.444
[sniffs, grunts]

38:00.945 --> 38:01.821
What's that?

38:03.447 --> 38:04.573
It smells like a lake.

38:13.040 --> 38:13.874
What is that?

38:15.543 --> 38:17.211
There's a strange energy in him.

38:21.048 --> 38:22.174
Are you a night watchman?

38:23.050 --> 38:24.051
Is everything all right?

38:24.135 --> 38:26.137
[ominous music continues playing]

38:29.432 --> 38:30.266
[gags]

38:44.655 --> 38:46.907
Hello, Mister. You're okay?

39:01.630 --> 39:03.799
[suspenseful music playing]

39:12.016 --> 39:13.601
I'm sure that he came in here.

39:42.797 --> 39:44.965
Hey, Mister, are you okay?

39:48.344 --> 39:49.470
[Bu-yeon] It's not inside this person.

39:51.222 --> 39:52.556
Where did that energy go?

39:53.891 --> 39:55.810
[suspenseful music continues playing]

40:15.037 --> 40:16.705
I can see you hiding in there.

40:17.832 --> 40:19.125
What is it here that you're after?

40:32.221 --> 40:35.141
This thing might be broken,
but it's still a Jinyowon relic.

40:36.016 --> 40:37.059
Eat this and go away.

40:46.944 --> 40:49.488
[eerie music playing]

41:09.216 --> 41:11.218
[exciting music playing]

41:40.706 --> 41:41.540
Young Master.

41:42.208 --> 41:44.418
I guess something strange
has entered the house again.

41:44.502 --> 41:46.003
Should I wake Maidservant Kim?

41:46.086 --> 41:47.421
I already took care of it.

41:47.505 --> 41:49.423
So there's no need
to wake her up and cause a fuss.

41:52.009 --> 41:54.136
You'll be cold
since you had contact with it.

41:54.762 --> 41:56.555
Drink some liquor before you go to bed.

41:56.639 --> 41:57.681
Uh, okay.

41:58.390 --> 42:01.977
This young lady came to
check on me and tried to help me.

42:03.062 --> 42:04.522
I suspect she'll also get cold.

42:04.605 --> 42:06.690
I'll bring a brazier and liquor for her.

42:09.985 --> 42:10.861
[sighs]

42:19.328 --> 42:20.663
[liquor pouring]

42:35.511 --> 42:37.513
[soft music playing]

42:57.408 --> 42:58.242
[exhales]

43:10.045 --> 43:11.088
[Bu-yeon] If you drink that,

43:11.630 --> 43:13.257
that means
we're officially married, all right?

43:14.675 --> 43:16.552
Let us think of it as the wedding drink.

43:30.941 --> 43:33.235
I guess everything's become
more complicated now.

43:36.030 --> 43:37.865
[Yun-o] Here is the portrait I received
before the wedding.

43:38.699 --> 43:39.992
You think you'll be able to find my bride?

43:40.075 --> 43:41.660
With the help of Songrim's merchants,

43:41.744 --> 43:45.122
every person in Daeho will see
this portrait by the end of today.

43:46.498 --> 43:50.085
I, Park Dang-gu,
will find Young Lady Cho-yeon's sister.

43:50.169 --> 43:51.587
[thrilling music playing]

43:52.171 --> 43:54.590
WHOEVER FINDS THIS LADY
WILL BE REWARDED GENEROUSLY

43:54.673 --> 43:56.425
[indistinct chatter]

43:56.508 --> 43:58.927
[woman] They say she's Jin Bu-yeon,
the eldest daughter of Jinyowon.

43:59.011 --> 44:01.513
Wow, all the Jinyowon's ladies are pretty.

44:01.597 --> 44:04.058
Wait! Whoever finds her will get a reward?

44:04.141 --> 44:05.684
[woman] Yes, it says right there.

44:05.768 --> 44:07.436
[man] Goodness, that's a lot!

44:10.272 --> 44:12.149
So, does that mean this Jin Bu-yeon

44:12.232 --> 44:13.984
is going to be
the next leader of Jinyowon?

44:14.068 --> 44:15.110
Of course.

44:15.694 --> 44:19.073
She's the priestess known for having
great powers ever since she was young.

44:19.156 --> 44:21.033
There has been a lot of talk
about this lately.

44:21.116 --> 44:22.951
They say Lady Jin should
no longer be in charge

44:23.035 --> 44:24.536
of the relics
because her powers have weakened.

44:25.871 --> 44:27.706
So this is good news for the Jin family.

44:29.041 --> 44:30.668
[Sun] Are you saying
there was talk of marriage

44:31.335 --> 44:33.003
between the Seo and Jin family?

44:33.754 --> 44:34.588
[Yun-o] Yes, Your Majesty.

44:35.339 --> 44:36.590
[Queen] We are cousins.

44:37.174 --> 44:39.468
How could you not let me know about this?

44:40.094 --> 44:43.097
Does even my own family
think so little of me…

44:44.807 --> 44:46.058
because I was reduced to this?

44:46.141 --> 44:47.643
No one in the family even knows.

44:47.726 --> 44:50.104
It had to be held in secret
because Lady Jin insisted.

44:50.187 --> 44:51.522
Please do not be angry.

44:51.605 --> 44:54.274
[Queen] Then she must also have
no respect for me

44:54.358 --> 44:57.444
when her dead husband
is the reason why I look like this!

44:57.528 --> 44:59.446
[breathes heavily]

44:59.530 --> 45:00.572
Now that I think about it,

45:01.740 --> 45:03.992
you want to marry into the family

45:04.576 --> 45:06.286
that put me in this hell?

45:07.830 --> 45:08.664
Forgive me, please.

45:08.747 --> 45:10.833
The marriage has been called off.
Please calm down!

45:13.419 --> 45:14.378
Not one person…

45:15.754 --> 45:17.214
knows the pain that I feel.

45:17.798 --> 45:21.677
I beg you to please
find a way for me to get out of this body?

45:21.760 --> 45:23.762
There's no way, don't you know?

45:26.974 --> 45:28.267
The alchemy of souls

45:29.184 --> 45:30.602
can't be used even if you are Queen.

45:32.271 --> 45:35.899
Regardless, now that Jinyowon's heir
has returned alive and well,

45:37.276 --> 45:40.571
they can appoint her
as the official heir next time.

45:49.371 --> 45:50.247
This…

45:51.790 --> 45:54.334
is the face of Jin Bu-yeon
who has returned?

45:54.418 --> 45:57.129
[Yeom-su] Yes. Seeing that
even Songrim is helping them find her,

45:57.212 --> 45:58.714
it must be true then.

46:08.599 --> 46:10.225
[Jin Mu] This is Naksu's face.

46:11.226 --> 46:14.229
I do not know about anyone else,
but her face is one I cannot forget.

46:14.313 --> 46:15.230
So…

46:16.315 --> 46:18.650
how can this be the face of Jin Bu-yeon?

46:20.152 --> 46:21.278
I must look into this.

46:26.783 --> 46:28.076
That is Jin Bu-yeon?

46:29.620 --> 46:30.454
It can't be.

46:31.413 --> 46:32.831
Jin Bu-yeon should be Mu-deok.

46:38.170 --> 46:39.838
You have to keep your body warm.

46:43.342 --> 46:46.136
Mr. Lee told me
all about what happened last night.

46:46.220 --> 46:47.596
I'm glad you're okay.

46:50.140 --> 46:51.683
I'm sorry for worrying you.

46:53.143 --> 46:53.977
But I…

46:54.978 --> 46:58.065
overheard that you tried
to leave last night.

47:00.025 --> 47:02.903
Did Young Master Jang not
say anything about last night?

47:02.986 --> 47:05.155
While you were unconscious,
he stayed by your side.

47:05.239 --> 47:08.575
Then he told me to give you
some medicine to help you with the chills.

47:08.659 --> 47:09.868
And then he left.

47:09.952 --> 47:12.829
So I'll leave for Sejukwon soon
to get you some medicine.

47:12.913 --> 47:13.747
Maidservant Kim.

47:13.830 --> 47:16.208
How many days' worth of medicine
did he ask you to get?

47:16.291 --> 47:18.210
He asked for three days' worth.

47:19.169 --> 47:20.087
Three days?

47:23.048 --> 47:25.425
Then I suppose I will be
staying in this house

47:25.509 --> 47:27.469
and taking medicine
for at least three more days.

47:34.434 --> 47:35.352
You must have…

47:36.562 --> 47:37.646
been startled last night.

47:38.564 --> 47:42.109
Wicked spirits like that
flock to Young Master Jang quite often.

47:44.069 --> 47:46.238
That's why he's never
been able to sleep much.

47:46.321 --> 47:47.823
Why are such things drawn to him?

47:49.283 --> 47:52.494
It's because of the great power
that is lying within him.

47:54.621 --> 47:56.665
They are drawn to it
like moths to a flame.

47:59.293 --> 48:01.920
[Bu-yeon] Did he need my powers
to drive such things away?

48:03.672 --> 48:05.549
He asked if I could
take out the ice stone.

48:07.342 --> 48:08.677
Will he find peace

48:09.595 --> 48:10.721
if it is removed?

48:17.519 --> 48:18.687
[sighs]

48:34.578 --> 48:36.580
[uplifting music playing]

48:49.009 --> 48:49.843
My lord.

48:51.053 --> 48:52.554
What are you doing today?

48:54.014 --> 48:56.266
Red beans. For porridge?

48:57.684 --> 49:01.188
I am… I'm going to
make meju with dry red beans.

49:02.272 --> 49:04.733
You'll make meju
with red beans, not soybeans?

49:04.816 --> 49:07.152
People use "Making meju with red beans"

49:07.235 --> 49:09.821
as an expression
to describe a lie or a bluff.

49:09.905 --> 49:12.157
But if I actually succeed
in making meju with red beans,

49:12.240 --> 49:15.994
then that expression will
no longer exist at all.

49:17.120 --> 49:20.248
Everyone in the world thinks
that it's virtually impossible, and I…

49:21.541 --> 49:22.918
shall prove them wrong.

49:26.296 --> 49:28.548
I'm going to give myself a challenge.

49:28.632 --> 49:31.385
You'll fail, my lord.
Meju is made with soybeans.

49:31.468 --> 49:33.178
- Still, red beans might work.
- Soybeans.

49:33.261 --> 49:34.513
- Red beans.
- Soy.

49:34.596 --> 49:35.514
- Red. Red.
- Soy. Soy.

49:35.597 --> 49:36.515
- Red. Red.
- Soy. Soy. Soy.

49:36.598 --> 49:37.766
- Red. Red. Red.
- Soy!

49:37.849 --> 49:38.934
- Red.
- Soy.

49:39.017 --> 49:39.976
- Red.
- Red.

49:40.060 --> 49:41.311
- Soy…
- Soy, red…

49:45.899 --> 49:49.903
I believe you and I truly do click
with one another on so many things.

49:49.986 --> 49:51.697
- [laughs]
- [sighs]

49:52.531 --> 49:56.493
Even if you make meju
with red beans, I won't be shocked.

49:57.244 --> 49:59.830
Because something more shocking
happened last night.

49:59.913 --> 50:00.997
Hmm?

50:01.081 --> 50:03.083
I mean, goodness. Young Master Jang

50:03.166 --> 50:05.627
brought home a young lady,
saying he'd marry her.

50:06.837 --> 50:09.548
You said Uk is doing what now? M-Marry?

50:09.631 --> 50:12.300
This is crazier than making
meju with red beans, is it not?

50:13.719 --> 50:16.221
But I thought
Uk still holds that girl in his heart.

50:16.304 --> 50:18.390
Yes, that girl…

50:21.184 --> 50:22.269
is still in here.

50:24.938 --> 50:25.772
My lord.

50:27.065 --> 50:30.944
I really hope you'll succeed
in making meju with red beans.

50:32.487 --> 50:34.656
So the impossible can come true.

50:36.116 --> 50:39.369
So Uk actually brought a woman
to his house, saying that he'd marry her.

50:45.792 --> 50:46.668
[Bu-yeon exhales]

50:46.752 --> 50:48.128
Three days taking medicine.

50:48.211 --> 50:50.547
If a man and a woman live
together for that long,

50:51.381 --> 50:52.632
they're basically married then.

50:54.885 --> 50:56.219
There's still some hope then.

51:01.725 --> 51:02.768
Who are you?

51:02.851 --> 51:05.228
I am the physician of the Young Master.

51:05.312 --> 51:07.856
I came because of Maidservant Kim.

51:07.939 --> 51:09.024
[chuckles]

51:09.107 --> 51:11.109
He even sent a physician
to take care of me.

51:11.193 --> 51:13.028
I mean, there's no need
for him to treat me this well.

51:14.654 --> 51:16.948
Who are you though?

51:17.032 --> 51:20.619
Young Lady Heo. This woman looks…
looks exactly like… like the lady

51:20.702 --> 51:22.871
that Young Master Park
and Young Master Seo are looking for.

51:24.956 --> 51:28.460
Maybe… Are you Jin Bu-yeon, by any chance?

51:28.543 --> 51:29.795
How do you know my name though?

51:30.462 --> 51:32.172
- No one knows who I am.
- [Sun-i gasps]

51:32.255 --> 51:33.590
What are you talking about?

51:33.673 --> 51:36.051
Your face is
all over the capital right now.

51:36.134 --> 51:37.511
Everyone is looking for you.

51:37.594 --> 51:39.179
What are you doing
in Young Master Jang's home?

51:39.262 --> 51:40.931
- You should leave now.
- That's rude!

51:43.183 --> 51:46.269
[Bu-yeon] They told everyone about me
and people are looking for me?

51:46.937 --> 51:48.188
But Mother would never do that.

51:49.523 --> 51:51.483
Then who is looking for me?

51:52.609 --> 51:54.653
Are those your clothes up there?

51:54.736 --> 51:56.112
[Yun-ok] Are they not wedding robes?

51:56.196 --> 51:58.365
Did you say a man
named Seo Yul is looking for me?

51:58.448 --> 52:00.492
What? Hmm…

52:00.575 --> 52:03.662
A man belonging to the Seo family
who lacks for nothing in every way?

52:03.745 --> 52:05.413
- That man?
- I suppose.

52:16.424 --> 52:18.385
What do you think
that Jin Bu-yeon was doing here?

52:19.302 --> 52:20.136
Not sure.

52:22.180 --> 52:24.349
Where are you going this time?

52:24.432 --> 52:27.686
I'm leaving now. Tell Jang Uk
that I do not need the medicine.

52:28.395 --> 52:29.312
Pardon?

52:37.821 --> 52:39.114
[Bu-yeon] It truly is Seo Yul.

52:40.115 --> 52:42.450
He's this desperate to find me
even though I ran away.

52:43.493 --> 52:45.704
Seeing that my face
has been revealed to the world,

52:46.204 --> 52:48.582
that means he must have gone
against my mother's wishes.

52:49.583 --> 52:52.085
It won't be a bad idea
to bet my life on him then.

52:55.714 --> 52:57.883
So you were a young lady of Jinyowon.

52:58.508 --> 52:59.342
[sighs]

52:59.426 --> 53:02.262
Please forgive me for not
recognizing you and calling you a thief.

53:02.846 --> 53:05.682
Everyone is looking for you.
Shall I escort you back now?

53:05.765 --> 53:08.310
First, I'd like to meet Yul
from the Seo family.

53:09.769 --> 53:11.062
Is he here now by chance?

53:11.146 --> 53:13.899
Ah, Seo Yul right now is, uh…

53:13.982 --> 53:16.651
He might be in his room. Please wait here.

53:19.195 --> 53:20.572
I guess I'll meet him first,

53:21.740 --> 53:24.367
and if he's all right,
then I'll choose him instead.

53:39.716 --> 53:40.675
[gasps]

53:42.093 --> 53:44.304
[soft music playing]

54:17.253 --> 54:18.380
Did he have…

54:20.173 --> 54:21.174
the wedding drink?

54:31.977 --> 54:34.729
[Ju-wol] You should never date a man
whose past is as painful

54:34.813 --> 54:37.232
as a sword being plunged into your chest.

54:41.277 --> 54:43.154
If it's a sword-like wound in the chest,

54:43.905 --> 54:45.323
I wonder how much it really hurts.

54:50.912 --> 54:52.664
Young Lady Jin. Young Lady Jin!

54:53.331 --> 54:54.958
Young Master Seo is coming right this way.

54:58.586 --> 55:00.547
[soft music playing]

55:20.150 --> 55:21.276
Everyone is looking for you,

55:22.110 --> 55:25.155
so I did not expect
that you'd come looking for me yourself.

55:25.739 --> 55:27.657
I apologize for running away
before the wedding.

55:28.575 --> 55:31.786
Now that I've met you,
I deeply regret doing so.

55:31.870 --> 55:33.830
If I'd already met you beforehand,

55:33.913 --> 55:37.375
I think I would have been tempted
to marry right away.

55:39.169 --> 55:40.879
Why would I have affected your decision?

55:40.962 --> 55:42.547
Well, because you're very handsome.

55:43.965 --> 55:47.427
It's only natural for a woman's heart
to be swayed by a handsome man.

55:47.510 --> 55:49.679
[whimsical music playing]

55:49.763 --> 55:50.597
[exhales]

55:50.680 --> 55:52.432
But that is as far as I can go.

55:52.515 --> 55:56.102
Because last night, I…
already gave my heart to someone else.

55:56.728 --> 55:59.647
I thought I'd brought everything with me
when I grabbed my wedding robes,

55:59.731 --> 56:04.110
but the memory of how I felt
after I drank that liquor still lingers.

56:08.740 --> 56:11.034
So are you saying
that you're not going to get married…

56:12.410 --> 56:13.661
into the Seo family?

56:14.788 --> 56:15.622
That's right.

56:15.705 --> 56:19.709
So I'd appreciate it if you'd be so kind
as to stop searching for me.

56:22.629 --> 56:23.838
I understand.

56:24.380 --> 56:26.591
I will relay this message
to my uncle then.

56:29.594 --> 56:30.470
Oh.

56:30.970 --> 56:32.722
Actually, I was not the one
who was to marry you.

56:32.806 --> 56:34.516
You're from the Seo family
at Seoho Fortress

56:34.599 --> 56:36.893
- who came by boat.
- Yeah, we came together.

56:38.103 --> 56:40.063
It seems you got confused
because you didn't know his name.

56:40.146 --> 56:41.189
It was really not you though?

56:44.317 --> 56:47.237
Wow, that's a relief then.
Now it's a lot easier to decline.

56:47.987 --> 56:50.949
Honestly, I was worried
that I would regret it a little bit.

56:51.658 --> 56:54.035
But now I feel fine.
[chuckles]

56:55.036 --> 56:55.912
[Seo Yul chuckles]

57:04.295 --> 57:05.213
What's the matter, Yul?

57:07.841 --> 57:11.261
I was just wondering
if, by any chance, we've met before.

57:14.597 --> 57:17.350
That's not possible
because I never go outside.

57:21.771 --> 57:24.399
I have three days of medicine to take,
so I must go now.

57:27.527 --> 57:29.112
Please pass my message along
to your uncle.

57:37.912 --> 57:40.665
- Let's go back, Young Lady Jin.
- Could you possibly give me

57:40.748 --> 57:42.709
a little more time?
I just need three days.

57:43.376 --> 57:45.795
After that, I'll willingly
go back to that room

57:46.880 --> 57:49.174
and stay locked away in there,
just as Mother wants.

57:49.799 --> 57:50.925
Three more days, please!

57:51.009 --> 57:53.178
No, I must obey Lady Jin's orders.

57:53.887 --> 57:54.721
[female mage] Come with us.

57:55.805 --> 57:56.639
[sighs]

58:07.275 --> 58:08.485
So has she been locked up?

58:13.573 --> 58:14.657
Ah, Young Master.

58:15.283 --> 58:17.410
That lady was from Jinyowon, right?

58:19.621 --> 58:22.415
The entire capital is busy
looking all over for her.

58:22.999 --> 58:25.710
You think that's why she left?

58:26.753 --> 58:27.879
- She left?
- Yeah.

58:27.962 --> 58:30.256
She even took
her wedding garments and everything.

58:30.340 --> 58:32.008
What in the world was that?

58:32.091 --> 58:34.594
If she's left, then that's it.
Just forget about yesterday.

58:38.556 --> 58:39.641
[sighs]

58:40.350 --> 58:41.184
I knew it.

58:42.143 --> 58:44.020
You can't make meju with red beans.

58:45.605 --> 58:46.439
[exhales deeply]

58:48.149 --> 58:49.025
[sighs]

58:53.488 --> 58:55.240
[wistful music playing]

59:11.130 --> 59:12.173
Now that it's broken,

59:13.216 --> 59:14.884
you can choose to go
anywhere you want, right?

59:16.177 --> 59:17.971
If you wish to run away, I can help.

59:18.054 --> 59:20.181
If you need it,
I can give you some money too.

59:20.265 --> 59:21.891
You won't tell them my name, right?

59:21.975 --> 59:24.352
So it's like a… settlement.

59:25.937 --> 59:26.980
My mother says that…

59:28.982 --> 59:30.483
after she lost me when I was little,

59:30.567 --> 59:32.777
she spent more than ten years
searching for me.

59:33.528 --> 59:36.072
While I do not wish to leave
because it's unbearable being locked up,

59:36.155 --> 59:38.074
I can't just completely disappear.

59:39.492 --> 59:40.410
If I do that…

59:42.579 --> 59:44.080
she'll lose her daughter again,

59:46.749 --> 59:48.960
and live every single day
in terrible agony.

59:54.465 --> 59:55.925
I can't do something like that to her.

01:00:00.096 --> 01:00:01.055
I guess she went back…

01:00:02.807 --> 01:00:03.891
and is locked up again.

01:00:13.860 --> 01:00:14.736
[Bu-yeon gasps]

01:00:29.459 --> 01:00:31.044
[breathes heavily]

01:00:34.297 --> 01:00:35.214
[sobs]

01:00:35.965 --> 01:00:37.216
My precious daughter.

01:00:38.384 --> 01:00:39.761
I thought I lost you again.

01:00:41.346 --> 01:00:42.555
I'm sorry, Mother.

01:00:44.390 --> 01:00:46.434
My daughter, Bu-yeon.

01:00:49.103 --> 01:00:49.937
My daughter.

01:00:55.443 --> 01:00:56.778
You broke off the engagement?

01:00:58.404 --> 01:00:59.822
The Queen is not happy with it.

01:01:01.115 --> 01:01:02.825
I didn't think that far ahead.
[clicks tongue]

01:01:02.909 --> 01:01:04.494
Then what will happen to that lady?

01:01:05.620 --> 01:01:06.454
That's not my concern.

01:01:07.121 --> 01:01:08.790
She's the daughter they locked away.

01:01:09.415 --> 01:01:11.250
I did them a favor by marrying her.

01:01:12.794 --> 01:01:14.420
But it was them who messed up.

01:01:18.633 --> 01:01:20.426
[grunts in pain]

01:01:22.011 --> 01:01:23.012
It's happening again?

01:01:23.096 --> 01:01:25.765
You came back to Daeho
because the pain had worsened.

01:01:25.848 --> 01:01:27.558
Did you get treated by Master Heo yet?

01:01:33.481 --> 01:01:35.775
Please do not tell anyone
about my condition, all right?

01:01:49.580 --> 01:01:53.668
His Majesty has ordered Jin Bu-yeon
to attend the Unanimous Assembly.

01:01:56.421 --> 01:02:00.341
Since when did the royal family
have control over the Unanimous Assembly?

01:02:01.718 --> 01:02:04.595
Did you advise him to do this
as the new Gwanju?

01:02:05.471 --> 01:02:07.890
[scoffs]
Well, just let me meet with her.

01:02:09.350 --> 01:02:12.478
I only saw a portrait of her,
but I'd like to meet her in person.

01:02:13.354 --> 01:02:14.188
Why?

01:02:15.940 --> 01:02:17.191
Why do you need to see her?

01:02:18.776 --> 01:02:21.028
Won't you say
that I'm her uncle, after all?

01:02:21.696 --> 01:02:25.116
So it is only natural
that I want to finally meet my dear niece.

01:02:25.616 --> 01:02:26.826
She's a pretty girl.

01:02:29.328 --> 01:02:30.788
Master Lee told me once

01:02:31.831 --> 01:02:34.417
that she resembles me in many ways.

01:02:35.835 --> 01:02:38.129
You mean Master Lee,
the pupil of Seo Gyeong?

01:02:38.212 --> 01:02:39.046
[Ho-gyeong] Yes.

01:02:39.130 --> 01:02:42.091
When we first found Bu-yeon,
she was very ill.

01:02:42.175 --> 01:02:44.969
Master Lee was helpful,
he treated Bu-yeon,

01:02:45.845 --> 01:02:46.804
and looked after her.

01:02:50.308 --> 01:02:51.601
Thanks to you, however,

01:02:52.351 --> 01:02:54.896
I once blindly welcomed a fake daughter.

01:02:54.979 --> 01:02:56.689
So I needed Master Lee's help

01:02:57.315 --> 01:02:59.066
to prevent such a thing
from happening again.

01:02:59.150 --> 01:03:00.026
[scoffs]

01:03:01.068 --> 01:03:04.489
If Master Lee confirmed it for you,
it must truly be Bu-yeon then.

01:03:04.572 --> 01:03:07.658
So why did you then keep her hidden away?

01:03:07.742 --> 01:03:09.994
- I told you she was ill.
- Is she still ill right now?

01:03:12.747 --> 01:03:15.374
It will be suggested
that all of Jinyowon's relics

01:03:16.292 --> 01:03:18.544
be moved elsewhere in this next meeting.

01:03:18.628 --> 01:03:21.339
In other words,
it is suggesting that Jinyowon

01:03:21.422 --> 01:03:23.466
should be taken over.

01:03:23.549 --> 01:03:25.051
That is just complete nonsense.

01:03:25.134 --> 01:03:27.678
It's all because of you barring
your gates for the past three years.

01:03:28.429 --> 01:03:32.433
The power of Jinyowon's leader
is getting weaker and weaker by the day.

01:03:32.517 --> 01:03:34.268
Meanwhile, she has no powerful heir.

01:03:34.352 --> 01:03:37.396
So why would anyone want
to leave the Jin family in charge

01:03:37.480 --> 01:03:39.982
of all those dangerous
and valuable relics and artifacts?

01:03:40.066 --> 01:03:40.900
Is that…

01:03:41.776 --> 01:03:45.112
really the advice you're giving me
as Cheonbugwan's Gwanju?

01:03:48.199 --> 01:03:50.618
Here is my advice to you as your brother.

01:03:51.661 --> 01:03:53.871
Bring Bu-yeon to the Unanimous Assembly.

01:03:53.955 --> 01:03:57.124
She is rumored to have talents
as powerful as Jin Seol-ran's.

01:03:58.376 --> 01:04:00.294
If you announce Bu-yeon as your heir,

01:04:01.963 --> 01:04:04.298
then you'll be able to keep Jinyowon.

01:04:10.513 --> 01:04:13.808
Very well. I'll see you
at the Unanimous Assembly.

01:04:20.982 --> 01:04:22.817
[suspenseful music playing]

01:04:36.330 --> 01:04:38.624
Jin Bu-yeon is going to attend
the Unanimous Assembly

01:04:38.708 --> 01:04:40.042
that's being held at Cheonbugwan.

01:04:41.878 --> 01:04:44.297
Jin Bu-yeon has been
the talk of the town here recently.

01:04:44.839 --> 01:04:46.215
So I guess she's finally showing up.

01:04:46.299 --> 01:04:47.758
Would you like to attend then?

01:04:47.842 --> 01:04:48.676
No way.

01:04:49.385 --> 01:04:51.012
I don't have fond memories of Jin Bu-yeon.

01:04:51.095 --> 01:04:53.639
The last time I went to see her,
I got trapped in a barrier.

01:04:53.723 --> 01:04:54.640
Oh, that's right.

01:04:54.724 --> 01:04:55.558
Indeed.

01:04:56.809 --> 01:04:58.311
It was so foggy
and I couldn't see anything.

01:04:58.394 --> 01:05:00.187
- Goodness!
- And it rained too.

01:05:00.271 --> 01:05:01.772
- Oh!
- [sighs]

01:05:09.906 --> 01:05:13.242
I tried to make meju with red beans,
but I failed miserably.

01:05:14.076 --> 01:05:15.870
So I made red bean porridge instead.

01:05:16.662 --> 01:05:17.830
How does it taste?

01:05:17.914 --> 01:05:21.125
You say you failed, but somehow
it tastes like meju a little bit.

01:05:21.208 --> 01:05:22.668
It does, does it not?

01:05:22.752 --> 01:05:25.379
I really think
I might be able to turn it into meju.

01:05:25.463 --> 01:05:27.965
Did you just invite me
to have me eat what you failed to make?

01:05:28.049 --> 01:05:28.883
Jang Uk.

01:05:30.801 --> 01:05:33.179
I heard you brought home
a woman you want to marry.

01:05:34.722 --> 01:05:36.682
I guess I should have known
that Maidservant Kim would tell you.

01:05:37.850 --> 01:05:40.561
Why did you have to kidnap
the priestess of Jinyowon…

01:05:41.938 --> 01:05:43.981
Huh? On the day of her wedding?

01:05:44.607 --> 01:05:45.441
Uh…

01:05:47.902 --> 01:05:48.778
because she's pretty.

01:05:48.861 --> 01:05:51.072
I was absolutely
mesmerized by her rare beauty.

01:05:51.155 --> 01:05:52.782
Did you really think that

01:05:52.865 --> 01:05:55.826
that rare beauty
could take out the ice stone for you?

01:05:58.245 --> 01:05:59.080
Why you--

01:05:59.163 --> 01:06:02.708
You should marry someone that
you really wish to spend your life with,

01:06:02.792 --> 01:06:05.169
not with someone
who will end up taking your life away.

01:06:05.252 --> 01:06:07.254
Please don't worry about it.
She went and ran away.

01:06:07.338 --> 01:06:08.172
Good!

01:06:09.465 --> 01:06:12.218
I heard she is going to be announced

01:06:12.301 --> 01:06:14.261
as the official heir
of Jinyowon later tonight.

01:06:16.097 --> 01:06:17.598
Jin Bu-yeon? How can she?

01:06:17.682 --> 01:06:19.558
[Jin] She has great divine powers.

01:06:20.226 --> 01:06:22.853
It seems like there have been concerns
regarding Jinyowon lately.

01:06:24.897 --> 01:06:26.857
If her eldest daughter attends
the Assembly tonight

01:06:26.941 --> 01:06:28.901
and is announced as her heir,

01:06:30.194 --> 01:06:32.405
Jinyowon will show
they still stand strong.

01:06:33.280 --> 01:06:35.032
They're trying to make meju
with red beans.

01:06:39.328 --> 01:06:40.705
Do you know what you must do

01:06:41.288 --> 01:06:43.416
to succeed in making meju
with red beans, huh?

01:06:46.335 --> 01:06:48.796
Is there really a way like that?

01:06:52.049 --> 01:06:53.175
It's to hide it and

01:06:54.051 --> 01:06:55.803
make sure to not let anyone else taste it.

01:06:55.886 --> 01:06:58.764
Does it really… taste that bad?

01:06:58.848 --> 01:07:00.307
- Yes.
- [chuckles]

01:07:00.891 --> 01:07:01.726
It really…

01:07:02.810 --> 01:07:04.645
- really tastes horrible.
- [laughs]

01:07:08.274 --> 01:07:09.608
I'll bring you some honey as well.

01:07:10.484 --> 01:07:12.528
Eat it as sweet porridge.

01:07:12.611 --> 01:07:13.738
[Jin clears throat]

01:07:25.291 --> 01:07:28.044
I mean, red beans can never
turn into meju. How foolish of her!

01:07:30.546 --> 01:07:31.464
[sighs]

01:07:31.547 --> 01:07:32.798
She should have just run away.

01:07:37.470 --> 01:07:39.263
[Ho-gyeong]
I did not want to take you there,

01:07:39.889 --> 01:07:43.684
but that is the only way
for us to protect Jinyowon.

01:07:44.685 --> 01:07:45.519
Mother.

01:07:46.437 --> 01:07:47.855
I have no powers.

01:07:49.065 --> 01:07:50.191
Will it be all right for you?

01:07:52.526 --> 01:07:53.360
That is why

01:07:54.862 --> 01:07:55.821
you must help us.

01:07:56.405 --> 01:07:58.824
Bu-yeon, you must truly never
leave this place again.

01:07:59.784 --> 01:08:03.370
Now that everyone knows your face,
you cannot meet with anyone.

01:08:05.456 --> 01:08:09.293
Because we cannot let
people know Jinyowon's heir

01:08:09.919 --> 01:08:11.629
doesn't have any divine powers.

01:08:14.006 --> 01:08:15.382
So then that means I…

01:08:17.593 --> 01:08:19.345
will be locked up in this room forever.

01:08:23.599 --> 01:08:26.560
Please do it, Bu-yeon, for your mother.

01:08:33.067 --> 01:08:34.652
Your tracking thread has snapped off.

01:09:00.594 --> 01:09:02.388
Let us tie it so it can never…

01:09:03.389 --> 01:09:04.265
break off again.

01:09:14.024 --> 01:09:16.193
[Bu-yeon breathes heavily]

01:09:19.488 --> 01:09:21.532
[unsettling music playing]

01:09:40.301 --> 01:09:41.218
[sighs]

01:09:46.765 --> 01:09:47.600
How…

01:09:49.560 --> 01:09:50.519
did that turn off?

01:09:51.103 --> 01:09:54.315
[Bu-yeon] Apparently, I lost my powers
at the same time I lost my memory.

01:09:56.025 --> 01:09:56.942
She clearly…

01:09:58.611 --> 01:10:00.070
told me that she could not turn it off.

01:10:01.405 --> 01:10:03.490
[dramatic music playing]

01:10:21.592 --> 01:10:22.885
[Bu-yeon] I may have deceived you,

01:10:24.053 --> 01:10:25.429
but not all that was a lie.

01:10:26.472 --> 01:10:28.432
[dramatic music continues playing]

01:10:39.235 --> 01:10:41.779
Are Jin Bu-yeon's powers that impressive?

01:10:41.862 --> 01:10:44.823
It was she who found
the ice stone, I heard.

01:10:44.907 --> 01:10:47.660
If she does indeed
make an appearance today,

01:10:47.743 --> 01:10:53.207
then allowing the Jin family
to retain Jinyowon seems to be okay.

01:11:07.846 --> 01:11:12.142
After today's assembly,
you will go back home to Jinyowon

01:11:12.977 --> 01:11:17.273
and never step outside again
just as you promised me.

01:11:25.072 --> 01:11:27.032
[dramatic music playing]

01:11:34.790 --> 01:11:36.333
So that's Jin Bu-yeon?

01:11:44.591 --> 01:11:46.302
I would like to take this opportunity

01:11:46.385 --> 01:11:49.179
to introduce you to the heir of Jinyowon.

01:11:56.353 --> 01:11:58.355
[dramatic music playing]

01:12:24.840 --> 01:12:26.133
Hello, everyone.

01:12:26.216 --> 01:12:28.010
I am the heir to Jinyowon.

01:12:29.428 --> 01:12:30.471
I'm Jin Bu-yeon.

01:12:49.615 --> 01:12:51.658
[wind howling]

01:12:55.245 --> 01:12:56.872
[male mage] What happened?

01:12:56.955 --> 01:12:58.499
[indistinct murmuring]

01:12:58.582 --> 01:13:00.084
- What is this?
- What is happening?

01:13:01.668 --> 01:13:02.503
[gate opens]

01:13:08.926 --> 01:13:10.761
[dramatic music continues playing]

01:13:52.719 --> 01:13:53.679
Jang Uk?

01:13:53.762 --> 01:13:56.140
Jang Uk? What is he doing here now?

01:14:04.606 --> 01:14:06.275
You left without taking your medicine.

01:14:07.025 --> 01:14:08.318
Everyone was looking for me.

01:14:08.402 --> 01:14:10.070
But what are you doing here?

01:14:10.154 --> 01:14:11.238
I'd like to check on something.

01:14:15.534 --> 01:14:18.036
This turned off. Did you do it?

01:14:19.997 --> 01:14:21.707
I turned the light on once again.

01:14:21.790 --> 01:14:23.083
Try turning it off now.

01:14:31.091 --> 01:14:31.925
Well, I…

01:14:34.511 --> 01:14:35.345
I can't.

01:14:41.059 --> 01:14:42.186
If you can,

01:14:43.228 --> 01:14:44.354
I'll take you with me.

01:14:53.947 --> 01:14:54.781
Wait a second…

01:15:01.830 --> 01:15:04.249
[indistinct murmuring]

01:15:06.293 --> 01:15:07.127
[Bu-yeon] It turned off.

01:15:10.422 --> 01:15:11.256
Did…

01:15:12.508 --> 01:15:13.509
did I do that?

01:15:15.427 --> 01:15:16.970
[epic music playing]

01:15:40.035 --> 01:15:41.328
What are you doing?

01:15:41.411 --> 01:15:42.246
Jin Bu-yeon…

01:15:44.665 --> 01:15:46.375
cannot become the heir of Jinyowon.

01:15:47.376 --> 01:15:48.752
What do you think you are doing?

01:15:50.879 --> 01:15:51.713
Jin Bu-yeon

01:15:52.673 --> 01:15:54.716
is already married to Jang Uk
of the Jang family.

01:15:56.677 --> 01:15:58.512
- What? Married?
- They got married?

01:15:58.595 --> 01:16:00.847
- [male mage 1] What is he saying?
- [male mage 2] Jin Bu-yeon and Jang Uk?

01:16:00.931 --> 01:16:02.891
Bu-yeon, what is this now?

01:16:09.398 --> 01:16:10.524
He is right, Mother.

01:16:12.693 --> 01:16:15.237
Jang Uk and I have already
shared the wedding drink together

01:16:16.446 --> 01:16:17.656
and have become married.

01:16:19.866 --> 01:16:21.577
I will never again return to…

01:16:24.204 --> 01:16:25.414
that room in Jinyowon.

01:16:39.469 --> 01:16:40.887
Bu-yeon and I are married.

01:16:42.472 --> 01:16:45.142
So please give us your blessings.

01:16:46.852 --> 01:16:48.854
[dramatic music playing]

01:17:10.834 --> 01:17:12.836
["I′m Sorry" by Ailee playing]

01:17:33.774 --> 01:17:36.693
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:17:37.194 --> 01:17:39.071
[Jang Uk]
If my powers are my justification,

01:17:39.154 --> 01:17:41.365
would you dare to even pick it apart?

01:17:41.948 --> 01:17:44.409
[Bu-yeon] To tell you the truth,
I was hoping that.

01:17:45.661 --> 01:17:46.912
Wh-What, what? No!

01:17:46.995 --> 01:17:50.040
I need to find out
whatever I can about Jin Bu-yeon.

01:17:50.957 --> 01:17:53.335
I feel like we've been
walking in circles for a while now.

01:17:53.960 --> 01:17:55.629
Who cares if you're a little dumb?

01:17:55.712 --> 01:17:56.672
I just got flustered.

01:17:56.755 --> 01:17:58.965
Wow! That looks delicious.

01:17:59.049 --> 01:18:00.467
Excuse me, Mister Eunuch,
do you have money?

01:18:00.550 --> 01:18:02.803
Me? Were you just talking to me?

01:18:02.886 --> 01:18:05.305
[Jin Mu] I shall summon
Naksu's soul once again.

01:18:05.389 --> 01:18:07.641
Jang Uk will be thrown into despair.
